    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Careful!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small squirrel lost in the woods in the dead of winter. While searching for your missing family you spot them on a small island, trapped. You need to rescue them! You must now search your environment for five keys in the snow, all while avoiding the very hunters that captured your parents before they freeze to death in the cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small 2D puzzle game in which you are a small squirrel exploring a dimly lit and dreary environment in order to find five keys so that you can save your family from impending peril, all while avoiding the overwhelming hunters which trapped you parents originally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an actively hostile environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for several keys lost in the snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the hunters and see as they slowly starve in the snow without their access to food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the environment degrades with each collected key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your family from the desperate hunters!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank You!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scurridaes is composed of a small group of developers who imagined, designed, and built this game in the span of twelve weeks, all while learning the basics of game design, scripting, and programming as university freshmen.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Careful!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a small squirrel lost in the woods in the dead of winter. While searching for your missing family you spot them on a small island, trapped. You need to rescue them! You must now search your environment for five keys in the snow, all while avoiding the very hunters that captured your parents before they freeze to death in the cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small 2D puzzle game in which you are a small squirrel exploring a dimly lit and dreary environment in order to find five keys so that you can save your family from impending peril, all while avoiding the overwhelming hunters which trapped you parents originally.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you\u2019ll:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an actively hostile environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for several keys lost in the snow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid the hunters and see as they slowly starve in the snow without their access to food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as the environment degrades with each collected key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your family from the desperate hunters!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank You!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scurridaes is composed of a small group of developers who imagined, designed, and built this game in the span of twelve weeks, all while learning the basics of game design, scripting, and programming as university freshmen.</p>",
